flowchart TD
    U[Citizen / Administrator] --> B[Web Browser]
    B --> F[Responsive HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, JavaScript]
    F -->|HTTPS in deployment| APP[Django Web Application - Gunicorn behind Nginx]
    APP --> AUTH[Authentication and Authorization]
    AUTH --> CM[Complaint Management Services]
    CM --> DB[(Relational Database: SQLite locally / managed DB in cloud)]
    CM --> UP[Local Uploads / Optional S3 or Azure Blob Storage]
    F --> MAP[Leaflet Map]
    MAP --> OSM[OpenStreetMap Tile Service]
    F --> CH[Chart.js Analytics]
    APP --> MON[Cloud Logs / Monitoring - optional]
    DB --> BK[Backups - deployment configuration]
